---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Explore an API from its OpenAPI document under the safety policy

Usage: rustman explore [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plan    Discover and plan probes without sending any request (a dry run)
  run     Discover, plan, send the probes and report the findings
  resume  Continue an interrupted exploration with the probes not yet run
  status  Show the phase, progress and findings of an exploration
  export  Write findings as regression request files for `rustman run`
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
